applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONDOH YUSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHYA KENJI</name><address><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKABE HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU YOSHIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOYO KASEI KOGYO CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONDOH, YUSUKE</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHYA, KENJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKABE, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU, YOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYO KASEI KOGYO COMPANY LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KONDOH YUSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHYA KENJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKABE HIROSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU YOSHIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KONDOH, YUSUKE</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHYA, KENJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKABE, HIROSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMIZU, YOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A centrifugal separator which is excellent in controllability, washability, visibility, and contamination resistance and which is provided with a rotating basket and its drive device mounted on an upper cover and cake delivery ports provided in the rotating basket and the bottom part of an outer case, characterized in that the upper cover is set fixedly on a frame through supporting leg parts, the outer case is supported fixedly to the upper cover and, at the time of washing, the outer case can be dismounted from the upper cover and can be moved downward under this dismounted state, and the rotating basket can be exposed to the outside by this downward movement.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un séparateur centrifuge commode à mettre en oeuvre et à laver et se distinguant par ses qualités de visibilité et de résistance à la contamination. Il est pourvu d'un panier rotatif dont l'entraînement est fixé sur un couvercle supérieur. Des orifices d'évacuation des gâteaux de filtration sont ménagés dans le panier rotatif et dans le fond d'une enceinte extérieure. Le séparateur de l'invention est caractérisé en ce que le couvercle supérieur est monté à demeure sur un châssis au moyen de montants servant de support. L'enceinte extérieure repose à demeure sur le couvercle supérieur. Pour le nettoyage, l'enceinte extérieure peut se démonter du couvercle supérieur et s'abaisser, donnant ainsi accès au panier rotatif.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>